mc: host the NeoForge + AP mod jars and add download links to the join steps

Players had to source the exact NeoForge installer and APRandomizer mod
themselves. Both jars are now staged on the Bifrost host at
/srv/archipelago/common/client/ (world-readable; bifrost is in the archipelago
group) and served read-only via GET /game/mc/{which} where which is neoforge or
mod, inheriting the /game archipelago_users SSO gating. The common-game join
steps now carry inline download links. The mod jar name is a single source of
truth (generate::MC_MOD_JAR, shared by the server-side route and the rendered
instructions) so the displayed name and served file cannot drift. The mod
declares side=BOTH, so clients need it.
